          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a nostalgia retro filter piece about gaming culture.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with hard low sun raking across the surface with long cast shadows and grade to a pastel low-contrast grade with a lifted black point.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
